{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Hunted in Maze&quot; is a gripping first-person horror action-adventure survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in an unfamiliar place, surrounded by towering walls with no memory of how you got there. The only way out lies through a massive, foreboding door that opens to a sprawling, pitch-black maze crawling with unspeakable horrors. By day, you must explore, gather resources, and unravel the mysteries of your surroundings before nightfall brings a wave of deadly creatures and unknown terrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a runner-survivor-rescuer, you'll collect vital supplies, artifacts, maps, and weapons while completing missions that reveal the dark secrets of this eerie world. Survive the night, master the maze, and uncover the truth behind the walls. Who is behind it all? And will you escape the maze before it consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to run, hide, fight, and uncover the mysteries of Hunted in Maze\u2014a game where every decision could mean the difference between survival and becoming just another victim of the maze.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439440?t=1746298222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746298222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/81ef1f78680bbcc6306c094673595a7292ae4944/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746298222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/81ef1f78680bbcc6306c094673595a7292ae4944/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746298222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Hunted in Maze&quot; is a gripping first-person horror action-adventure survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in an unfamiliar place, surrounded by towering walls with no memory of how you got there. The only way out lies through a massive, foreboding door that opens to a sprawling, pitch-black maze crawling with unspeakable horrors. By day, you must explore, gather resources, and unravel the mysteries of your surroundings before nightfall brings a wave of deadly creatures and unknown terrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a runner-survivor-rescuer, you'll collect vital supplies, artifacts, maps, and weapons while completing missions that reveal the dark secrets of this eerie world. Survive the night, master the maze, and uncover the truth behind the walls. Who is behind it all? And will you escape the maze before it consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to run, hide, fight, and uncover the mysteries of Hunted in Maze\u2014a game where every decision could mean the difference between survival and becoming just another victim of the maze.</p>","developers":["LRDev Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/cbb45559f4fe67d34fbab5cf2522dbc69e21c530/header.jpg?t=1746298222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132251,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132251/movie480.mp4?t=1745940039","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257